import DkMath.FLT.Three.PositiveCubicNormalization

/-!
# DkMath exponent-three public surface

This is the standalone public import surface for the DkMath exponent-three
development.  Its endpoint is `DkMath.FLT.Three.fermatThree_no_positive_solution`.
The proof route is GN3, signed 3-adic routing, Eisenstein Euclidean arithmetic,
unit sectors, and strict descent.  It does not use a completed FLT3 theorem as
a proof step and is independent of the legacy `DkMath.FLT.Main` surface.
-/
